' UC-AGA-03 — Request Facility User Onboarding

@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle inside
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFEAA7
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #DFE6E9

|Facility Administrator|
start
:1.0 Access facility onboarding request function;

|WAHrden System|
:1.1 Verify facility administrator authority & scope;
if (Authorized for facility?) then (No [EF-01])
  :Present scope/authority denial;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :1.2 Present onboarding request form;
endif

|Facility Administrator|
:2.0 Provide prospective-user & requested access details;

|WAHrden System|
:2.1 Validate request completeness and facility scope;
if (Within authorized scope?) then (No [EF-03])
  :Prevent submission; scope validation failure;
  kill
elseif (Information valid & complete?) then (No [EF-02])
  :Present validation issue & prompt correction;
  kill
else (Valid)
  :2.2 Present request summary for confirmation;
endif

|Facility Administrator|
if (Confirm submission?) then (No / Cancel [EF-04])
  :Cancel request submission;
  kill
else (Yes [3.0])
  :Confirm onboarding request submission;
endif

|WAHrden System|
:3.1 Save request in 'Pending' state;
if (Save successful?) then (No [EF-05])
  :Present request submission failure;
  kill
else (Yes)
  |Database / Audit|
  :3.2 Record pending request & audit entry;
  
  |WAHrden System|
  :3.3 Present submission confirmation to administrator;
endif

|Facility Administrator|
:Acknowledge Pending request status;
stop
@enduml
